    "confidence": 0.9,
    "explanation": "Both parties: this is a ROUTE_DEVIATION dispute, and the only thing the policy prices is whether the distance actually driven exceeded the booked optimal route by more than the POL-RD-01 gate. It did not. POL-RD-01 makes gps_trace.trace_distance_km the governing figure where it disagrees with the rounded trip-record copy. The trace (EV-GPS-00535) records 20.35 km against the booked optimal of 20.1 km — an excess of 0.25 km, 1.24% of optimal. The clause requires the excess to beat both 0.8 km in absolute terms and 20% of optimal; 0.25 km fails both, the platform's own derived status reads 'no deviation', and the rider's own advocate concedes the point. POL-RD-01 therefore directs NO_ACTION however the trip is characterised. On the driver's side, the expressway accident and the LTA advisory (EV-ADVIS-00535-01) explain the 67-minute runtime against the 44-minute estimate, but the route-deviation policy does not price delay, and POL-RD-03 exoneration has no deviation to excuse here — the whole measured excess of 0.25 km already sits inside its cap. The chat log (EV-CHAT-00535) is empty: it carries no rider instruction and no driver admission. The rider's asserted consequential losses (the missed connection and SGD 200 of train changes) are not lines of the metered fare — EV-FARE-00535 prices distance, time, base fare and platform fee only, and POL-RD-02 can only move the difference between the charged total of SGD 38.66 and a recomputed optimal-route fare, a computation that is never reached because no deviation is established. The SGD 30.00 contested therefore stands. On the driver profile, no POL-RD-06 repeat-deviation pattern is open (EV-DPROF-00535 records deviation_flags_90d = 0 against 250 completed trips in 90 days), so no conduct referral fires, and there is no POL-RD-09(4) billing-integrity line to correct (ERP, tolls and surcharges are all SGD 0.00). The trace is unimpaired for policy purposes (100% coverage, 403 fixes at 10 s cadence, no gaps) and every artifact relied on sits at weight 1.0, so nothing is discounted and no escalation arises. The charge is left in place: payment_status CHARGED and refund_issued_sgd SGD 0.00 are unchanged."
  },
  "discarded_claims": []
}

